From 69c178d26873c1c023dc9a8d539254c5ab06e6e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Corvid <corvid@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:53:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Fork: automatic check before broadcasts

A schedule chosen in the panel (times, weekdays, time zone) runs a check of the
graphics card encoder (short test encode), free disk space, stream keys and,
per channel, source and backup senders, standby image and publication targets.
GET/POST /api/v3/fork/selftest, PUT /api/v3/fork/selftest/schedule (admin).
The reach check moves into its own package.

